This covers: data/processed/, data/enrich/ (LLM extraction outputs, entity kinds,
plan and logs), app/public/data/ (the published JSON bundle), config/taxonomy.yaml
crosswalk tables and the generated reports in reports/.

These files are adapted from the AI Incident Database (https://incidentdatabase.ai),
Responsible AI Collaborative, licensed CC BY-SA 4.0. Changes: re-coding of incidents
with a new taxonomy, summaries, similarity graphs, clusters and statistics.

Short quotations (≤ 25 words) from news reports are included for evidence
grounding under fair use / quotation exceptions, each attributed and linked to
its publisher. Report texts themselves are not part of this repository and are not
covered by this license.
